===Marriage, gender, and kinship===
{{See also|Women in ancient and imperial China#Han dynasty|label1=Women in Han China}}
[[File:Dahuting tomb mural detail of women wearing hanfu, Eastern Han period.jpg|thumb|Detail of an Eastern Han mural showing two women wearing ''[[Hanfu]]'' robes, from Dahuting, [[Zhengzhou]], Henan province]]

