===Mechanical and hydraulic engineering===
{{further|History of science and technology in China}}
{{Multiple image
|total_width=400
|image1=Mold for bronze gear Han dynasty.jpg
|alt1=A ceramic mold with a hollowed out section for smelting bronze gears
|image2=Iron scissors, E Han.JPG
|alt2=Pair of rusted iron scissors
|image3=Winnowing machine and tilt hammer.JPG
|alt3=Small ceramic model of two men operating a tilt hammer and winnowing machine
